    {
      "id": "intro_5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "I am always amazed when I hear people saying that sport creates goodwill between the nations, and that if only the common peoples of the world could meet one another at football or cricket, they would have no inclination to meet on the battlefield.",
      "translation": "每当我听到人们说体育能在国家间创造善意，以及如果世界各国人民能在足球或板球比赛中相遇，就不会有在战场上相遇的意愿时，我总是感到惊讶。",
