    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "On the village green, where you pick up sides and no feeling of local patriotism is involved, it is possible to play simply for the fun and exercise: but as soon as a the question of prestige arises, as soon as you feel that you and some larger unit will be disgraced if you lose, the most savage combative instincts are aroused.",
      "translation": "在村庄的草地上，你随意分队，不涉及地方爱国主义情感，可以纯粹为了娱乐和锻炼而比赛：但一旦出现声望问题，一旦你觉得你和某个更大的团体如果输了就会蒙羞，最野蛮的好斗本能就会被激起。",
